        <mxCell id="1y0eVGkfd-wTPIM0Y5jU-39" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#030303;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=pre;rounded=0;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Courier New;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingBottom=10;spacingRight=10;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 13px;&quot;&gt;You are a Hadith scholar. I will give you a specific Hadith reference.&lt;br&gt;Provide the exact English text of that Hadith only.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Book: {source}&lt;br&gt;Chapter Number: {chapter_no}&lt;br&gt;Chapter Name: {chapter}&lt;br&gt;Hadith Number: {hadith_no}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Rules:&lt;br&gt;- Provide only the Hadith text&lt;br&gt;- Do not add any explanation or commentary&lt;br&gt;- Start directly with &quot;Narrated&quot; or the hadith content&lt;br&gt;- You already have everything you need above. Do not ask questions,&lt;br&gt;  do not ask for confirmation, and do not request the reference&lt;br&gt;  again. Answer now.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" vertex="1">
